! Section 11B: physical parameters - dual permeability
! --------------------------------------------------------------------------
!
'physical parameters - dual permeability'

! Shape factor (B) represents the geometry of aggregates
'geometry shape factor'
3.0

! Scaling factor (Yw) is an empirical factor
'scaling factor'
0.4

! Effective diffusion path length (a) represents the distance
! from the center of a fictitious matrix block to the fracture boundary
'effective diffusion path length'
0.01

! Effective saturated hydraulic conductivity of the preferential flow
! and matrix interface. Typically used as a calibration parameter
'effective hydraulic conductivity'
2.315d-6

! The effective diffusion coefficient (Da) of the matrix block near interface
'effective diffusion coefficient'
5d-9

'free phase gas diffusion coefficient'
2.1d-5

'tortuosity parameters'
-0.66        ; a_mq
2.33         ; b_mq

! Ratio of the volumes of the fracture (wf) and the total pore system
'fracture proportion'
0.05

'interface of matrix and fracture in y-direction'
0.05

'done'

